# ─── Files `make worktree` copies into a fresh worktree ───
#
# One gitignore-style pattern per line. Every path listed here is gitignored (that is the
# point — the files a worktree cannot get from git because they are never committed), and
# `scripts/worktree.ts` copies each match from the main checkout into the new one.
#
# Kept deliberately short. Anything a worktree can regenerate cheaper than copy
# (node_modules, the Playwright browser) is NOT here, because the shared browser directory
# and Bun's hardlink cache make those near-free.
.env
